{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25398","headline":"东郡怀古二首 王京兆 · 李德裕","name":"东郡怀古二首 王京兆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河水昔将决，冲波溢川浔。\n峥嵘金堤下，喷薄风雷音。\n投马灾未弭，爲鱼叹方深。\n惟公执珪璧，誓与身俱沈。\n诚信不虚发，神明宜尔临。\n湍流自此回，咫尺焉能侵。\n逮我守东郡，凄然怀所钦。\n虽非识君面，自谓知君心。\n意气苟相合，神明无古今。\n登城见遗庙，日夕空悲吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}